# No PRIVATE key ever belongs in this repo. The release key reaches CI as an organisation secret
# read straight from the environment (release-tooling's seal.py --key-env), so there is no keyfile
# to commit by accident — and this is the net under that rule, not the rule itself.
*.key

# Build outputs. mirrors.json is GENERATED from mirrors.d/ at publish time and only ever exists as
# a release asset; a copy committed here would be a second answer to "what is published", free to
# disagree with the signed one.
/mirrors.json
/mirrors.json.minisig

# Bytecode from running the selftest.
__pycache__/
